# battle-background v1 (LOCKED GATE 3) — vars: {habitat}, {palette_rows}
# model: flux_2 pro 1k, aspect 3:2 — feeds postprocess.py --kind background (240x160)
Pixel art game battle background, wide landscape view of: {habitat}.
Composition: open lower third as flat battle floor, scenery in middle and
upper bands, nothing in the center foreground. Colors strictly from: {palette_rows}.
GBA Pokemon FireRed battle backdrop style, flat shapes, 2x2 checker dithering
allowed for sky only, no gradients otherwise, limited palette.
No creatures, no people, no text, no watermark, no frame.
